@page "/getting-started"
@namespace CymruBlazor.Demo.Pages.GettingStarted

<div class="cb-page-header">
    <h1 class="cb-page-title">Getting Started</h1>
    <p class="cb-page-description">
        CymruBlazor is an open-source Blazor component library implementing the
        NHS Wales Design System, for any Blazor WebAssembly or Blazor Server
        project. This page covers what it is and how it's built; for the
        step-by-step setup, see <a href="/installation">Installation</a>.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="cb-section">
    <h2 class="cb-section-title">What is CymruBlazor?</h2>
    <p class="cb-section-description">
        A set of accessible, composable Blazor components - layout primitives,
        form controls, content and navigation elements - styled to the DHCW
        "Single Record Design System" and distributed as a single NuGet
        package. Icons, theming, and design tokens all ship as part of the
        core package; nothing extra to install.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="cb-section">
    <h2 class="cb-section-title">Design principles</h2>

    <table class="cb-api-table" aria-label="Design principles">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Principle</th>
                <th>What it means</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>

        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">Accessible by default</td>
                <td>Every component is built to WCAG 2.2 AA, not retrofitted afterwards.</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">Composable</td>
                <td>Small, single-purpose components that connect together instead of one large monolith.</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">Design tokens</td>
                <td>Colour, spacing, and typography are tokenised CSS custom properties aligned to Welsh NHS branding guidelines - see <a href="/foundations/tokens">Design Tokens</a>.</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">Minimal JavaScript</td>
                <td>Interop is used only for genuine browser API calls (e.g. clipboard, focus); behaviour otherwise lives in C#.</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">Mediator pipeline</td>
                <td>Cross-cutting concerns, such as screen-reader live-region announcements, flow through a shared Mediator pipeline rather than direct component references.</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">Welsh language support</td>
                <td>Native language toggling primitives for Welsh and English content.</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="cb-section">
    <h2 class="cb-section-title">See it in action</h2>

    <p class="cb-section-description">
        Layout primitives compose to build any NHS Wales-aligned page structure.
    </p>

    <pre><code>&lt;CyContainer Size="ContainerSize.Large"&gt;
    &lt;CyStack Orientation="Orientation.Vertical" Gap="ComponentSize.Medium"&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;Hello, NHS Wales&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Built with CymruBlazor.&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/CyStack&gt;
&lt;/CyContainer&gt;</code></pre>

    <div class="cb-example">
        <span class="cb-example__label">Live preview</span>

        <div class="cb-example__preview">
            <CyContainer Size="ContainerSize.Large">
                <CyStack Orientation="Orientation.Vertical"
                         Gap="ComponentSize.Medium">
                    <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:var(--cymru-font-size-2xl)">
                        Hello, NHS Wales
                    </h1>

                    <p style="margin:0;color:var(--cymru-color-text-muted)">
                        Built with CymruBlazor.
                    </p>
                </CyStack>
            </CyContainer>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="cb-section">
    <h2 class="cb-section-title">Requirements</h2>

    <table class="cb-api-table" aria-label="Prerequisites">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Dependency</th>
                <th>Version</th>
                <th>Notes</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>

        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">.NET SDK</td>
                <td class="cb-api-table__type">10.0+</td>
                <td>Required for all Blazor projects</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">Mediator.SourceGenerator</td>
                <td class="cb-api-table__type">3.0.2+</td>
                <td>Source-generated pipeline — included transitively</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <td class="cb-api-table__name">Blazor WebAssembly or Server</td>
                <td class="cb-api-table__type">10.0+</td>
                <td>Both hosting models supported</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<div class="cb-section">
    <p class="cb-section-description">
        Ready to add it to your project? Head to
        <a href="/installation">Installation</a> for the complete, copy-pasteable setup steps.
    </p>
</div>
